{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Living Longer Better", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Sleep and Memory", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 11, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Present Perfect Tense vs. The Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about an action or an event that occurred in the past, but you do not specify when it occurred (maybe it's not relevant to say when it happened), you use the present perfect.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you want to say when an action or an event occurred at a specific time in the past, you use the simple past. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We have some time expressions for Present Perfect which refers to indefinite time and some for simple past which refers to definite time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":12,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"indefinite\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I have done it ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"for a long time.\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lately.\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"since this morning.\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"before.\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"recently.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Simple\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"definite\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I did it ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"yesterday.\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"last night.\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"two days ago.\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"at 8 o'clock.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Necessity", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about what is necessary, you use <span class=\"italic\">have got to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">going to have to</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Necessity\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Before your next big test, you have to set up a sleep schedule.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You're going to have to get 8 hours of sleep each night.  </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If you want to have a better memory, you have got to get your rest. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to encode", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to send complicated messages in a simple way ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: At night the day's information is encoded in your brain. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about sleep.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to transfer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to move from one position to another ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The information is transferred to your long term memory. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to retrieve ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to bring back ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: In the morning, the information is easy to retrieve. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "schedule", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a notation of times when something is to happen ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Make up a sleep schedule. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "calm", "type": "name"}, {"content": "slow and relaxed  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You feel calm and refreshed after a good night's sleep. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "rested", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having energy after relaxation or sleep  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He always feels rested after 8 hours of sleep. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "remembering", "type": "name"}, {"content": "placing information in your mind  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Are you having problems remembering things? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "experiment ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "when something is tried to see if it works   ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Experiments show that memory and sleep are related. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob07aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "crucial ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "important  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sleep is crucial for brain function. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob07aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to reinforce", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make stronger ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Memory is reinforced while we sleep.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob07aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Every day for 5 days, write 3 sentences about how you have slept.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Describe how long you have slept and how you feel in the morning. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say how you think your memory is.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your sleep diary to a friend or classmate.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I keep a sleep diary for 5 days.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe how I feel after I have slept.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I assess my memory.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my diary aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le11ob07re2img02.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le11ob07re2img02.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "You haven't felt rested lately? You found that remembering was difficult?  If this is true, you're going to have to get a little more sleep.  Sleep is crucial to your brain's ability to learn and remember.  Experiments have shown that our memory is reinforced while we sleep. So, if you want to have a better memory, you have got to get your rest."}, {"image": "engenn6le11ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "22000", "id": 2, "text": "Have you learned a lot lately? Did you sleep well that night? If you did, your brain encoded that information while you slept. Then, it transferred the data to your long term memory. When you woke, that information was ready to retrieve! If you haven't experienced this, you're going to have to give it a try."}, {"image": "engenn6le11ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "43000", "id": 3, "text": "Has exam writing always been a little difficult? Before your next big test you've got to set up a sleep schedule. You're going to have to get 8 hours of sleep each night.  Then, you'll be  rested, calm, and ready. Try it. You have nothing to lose!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le11ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le11ob07re2img02.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about staying healthy. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss experiences I've had or haven't had. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about what is necessary.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you ever had insomnia? Do you know someone who has? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How do you think insomnia can be treated?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time